# CTA copy

Do not use generic billing CTAs like **Start free trial**, **Start your free trial**, **Try free**, or **Subscribe** on buttons.

Use the shared labels from `lib/marketing/cta.js`:

- Trial / signup primary CTA → `CTA_TRIAL` (`Stop Losing Leads`)
- Subscribe / activate plan CTA → `CTA_SUBSCRIBE` (`Unlock Pro Features`)

Keep trial/plan details in supporting copy, badges, or pricing text — not in the button label.
Keep CTAs outcome-focused and product-specific (missed leads / lost revenue), not generic SaaS trial language.
